   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "It finds academic conferences, journal calls and fellowships, and scores whether each one is worth the time and\nmoney for a specific researcher — fit, cost, funding, visa. The diagram below is what happens after someone clicks\n\"Full check\" on one result.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "baseline": 14,
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "It finds academic conferences, journal calls and fellowships, and scores whether each one is worth the time and\nmoney for a specific researcher — fit, cost, funding, visa. The diagram below is what happens after someone clicks\n\"Full check\" on one result.",
   "lineHeight": 1.35
  },
