   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "If one of the 3 middle agents is slow or fails, the check still finishes — just with a note saying that part is a partial result.\nOnly the last agent (\"write the final verdict\") has no backup plan: if it fails, the whole check fails and the person can retry.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "baseline": 14,
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "If one of the 3 middle agents is slow or fails, the check still finishes — just with a note saying that part is a partial result.\nOnly the last agent (\"write the final verdict\") has no backup plan: if it fails, the whole check fails and the person can retry.",
   "lineHeight": 1.3
  },
